@title Problem triangles T9: a failed EPLAN parts import leaves a job flag, not a toast
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
@area Parts
# A file that is not a parts export: the failure stays as a triangle in the Parts window until dismissed or the import works.
open_starter_example
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text Parts
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text Import parts from a CAD parts export
wait 10
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/parts/not-text.csv
key Return
wait 40
shot failed-eplan-import
expect "EPLAN parts not read"
check_layout
